<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Being hurt by another person (RimWorld: ThoughtDefOf.HarmedMe, a Thought_MemorySocial). Given by
    Health.Pawn_HealthTracker.PostApplyDamage when a humanlike harms another humanlike it is not at war with
    (friendly fire, a social fight), or one of its own while in a mental state. Its own file rather than an
    addition to Thoughts_Social.xml, per CLAUDE.md.

    Sourced: -15 opinion for 10 days (rimworldwiki.com, Opinion: "Harmed me"). It is a social memory with no
    mood effect. Not sourced: the stack limits. stackLimit 300 is recalled from RimWorld's social memories
    rather than read from the def; stackLimitForSameOtherPawn 3 is this port's choice, the same as Insulted,
    so a long fight weighs more than one blow but stops growing after three (pinned by HarmedMeTests).
  -->

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>HarmedMe</defName>
    <durationDays>10</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>300</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>3</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>harmed me</label>
        <description>They hurt me.</description>
        <baseOpinionOffset>-15</baseOpinionOffset>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
